{"version": 2, "width": 80, "height": 24, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0.129461, "o", "\u001b[1mNestor \u2014 has a human checked this?\u001b[0m"]
[0.129487, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.129513, "o", "   \u001b[2ma scratch store and ledger in /tmp/nestor-demo-q_u366gj\u001b[0m"]
[0.12952, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.329958, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m1. Ask it something nobody has verified.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n   \u001b[2m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1mnestor ask \"The supplier shall deliver within thirty day\u2026\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.835314, "o", "   \u001b[31m! pending\u001b[0m   nothing verified matches this\r\n"]
[2.135588, "o", "   \u001b[2mIt does not present a guess as an answer. Unverified is a state, not a\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.435713, "o", "   \u001b[2mlower confidence score buried in a field nobody reads.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.643426, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m2. A human verifies it. Once.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n   \u001b[2m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1mnestor ui   \u2192   sign in as rita, correct it, seal\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.143631, "o", "   \u001b[32m\u2713\u001b[0m sealed by \u001b[1mrita\u001b[0m   El proveedor entregar\u00e1 en un plazo de treinta d\u00edas d\u2026\r\n"]
[4.443874, "o", "   \u001b[2mSigned with rita's own key, which the database does not hold.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.644145, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m3. Ask again \u2014 retyped, different case, no punctuation.\u001b[0m"]
[5.644219, "o", "\r\n\r\n   \u001b[2m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1mnestor ask \"the supplier shall deliver within thirty day\u2026\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.145754, "o", "   \u001b[32m\u2713 sealed\u001b[0m   El proveedor entregar\u00e1 en un plazo de treinta d\u00edas desde la fecha del pedido."]
[6.145775, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.446035, "o", "              verified by \u001b[1mrita\u001b[0m, similarity 1.0"]
[6.448621, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.748798, "o", "   \u001b[2mRight forever after, for anyone who asks \u2014 a person at the UI, the CLI,\u001b[0m"]
[6.748824, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.049168, "o", "   \u001b[2mor a model over MCP. One human, one time.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.251277, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m4. A rewrite that means the same thing.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n   \u001b[2m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1mnestor ask \"The vendor shall deliver within thirty days \u2026\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.753218, "o", "   \u001b[33m~ draft\u001b[0m     nothing verified matches this \u2014 closest scores 0.812\r\n"]
[9.053312, "o", "   \u001b[2mUnder the 0.92 cutoff, so it goes back to a human rather than\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.35551, "o", "   \u001b[2mout as verified. Close is what a false verification is made of.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.555738, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m5. And the part a demo usually leaves out.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n   \u001b[2m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1mnestor ask \"The supplier shall deliver within sixty days\u2026\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.057361, "o", "   \u001b[32m\u2713 sealed\u001b[0m   El proveedor entregar\u00e1 en un plazo de treinta d\u00edas desde la \u2026"]
[11.057422, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.360253, "o", "      \u001b[31m\u2026and thirty days is not sixty days.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.659267, "o", "   \u001b[2mIt scores 0.96 because two characters changed. A character-ratio\u001b[0m"]
[11.659335, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.959622, "o", "   \u001b[2mmatcher does not read; it measures. That failure mode is measured, not\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.259816, "o", "   \u001b[2mhidden \u2014 bench/ sweeps it, `nestor calibrate` tells you where the cutoff\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.559946, "o", "   \u001b[2mbelongs for YOUR corpus, and a reviewer's rejection of this answer is\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.860217, "o", "   \u001b[2mrecorded and read back as evidence the dial is wrong here.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[14.060477, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m6. Someone with database access forges a seal.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n   \u001b[2m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1msqlite3 nestor.db \"insert \u2026 status='sealed', verifier='rita'\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[14.561696, "o", "   the row says \u001b[1msealed\u001b[0m, by \u001b[1mrita\u001b[0m, and scores \u001b[1m1.000\u001b[0m \u2014 an exact match\r\n"]
[14.863441, "o", "   \u001b[31m! pending\u001b[0m   nothing verified matches this \u2014 closest scores 1.0\r\n"]
[15.163613, "o", "   \u001b[2mWriting the database is not enough. A seal is a signature over\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.463758, "o", "   \u001b[2m(source, answer, verifier) under rita's key \u2014 and that key is not in\u001b[0m"]
[15.463815, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.763921, "o", "   \u001b[2mthe database being written. It shows up in the curator's unverifiable\u001b[0m"]
[15.763993, "o", "\r\n"]
[16.064144, "o", "   \u001b[2mlist instead: a row claiming a verification nobody made.\u001b[0m"]
[16.064217, "o", "\r\n"]
[17.266438, "o", "\r\n"]
[17.2665, "o", "\u001b[1m7. Every decision above is in the ledger, and the chain holds.\u001b[0m"]
[17.266518, "o", "\r\n"]
[17.266538, "o", "\r\n   \u001b[2m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1mnestor ledger verify\u001b[0m"]
[17.266551, "o", "\r\n"]
[17.767058, "o", "   \u001b[32m\u2713\u001b[0m intact \u2014 6 entries"]
[17.767174, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.067409, "o", "   \u001b[2mkinds: passage, seal\u001b[0m"]
[18.067483, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.368161, "o", "   \u001b[2mhead 3caa817e6133e31177318888461f6bcf\u2026\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.571772, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m8. Now edit the trail. One field, in one past entry.\u001b[0m\r\n   entry 1: verifier 'rita' \u2192 'someone-else'\r\n"]
[19.871929, "o", "\r\n   \u001b[2m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1mnestor ledger verify\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.372349, "o", "   \u001b[31m\u2717\u001b[0m broken chain at line 3: prev='ee34ee69492553d42e4bd6492a53cd127c5dafb88540f41714d027aaeb5c3c45' expected 'bdb4c46e32879d83eaab68ce750dac170e749732ce7a93446d12c47445b6db31'\r\n"]
[20.672528, "o", "   \u001b[2mNothing else was touched. Each line carries the hash of the line before\u001b[0m"]
[20.672617, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.972864, "o", "   \u001b[2mit, so changing who sealed something breaks every link after it.\u001b[0m"]
[20.973178, "o", "\r\n"]
[21.273329, "o", "\r\n   \u001b[2m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1mnestor ask \u2026    # and the next decision is refused too\u001b[0m"]
[21.273396, "o", "\r\n"]
[21.77383, "o", "   \u001b[31m\u2717\u001b[0m LedgerError: the entry this process last wrote to /tmp/nestor-demo-q_u366gj/ledger.jsonl \u2026\r\n"]
[22.074296, "o", "   \u001b[2mIt will not chain a new decision onto a history it cannot vouch for,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.374599, "o", "   \u001b[2mand it refuses before writing the row rather than after. The trail is\u001b[0m"]
[22.37467, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.674896, "o", "   \u001b[2mnot evidence you have to trust \u2014 it is evidence that will not be\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.975089, "o", "   \u001b[2mquietly rewritten.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[24.275309, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1mSixty seconds.\u001b[0m An answer nobody had checked; one human, one time;"]
[24.28342, "o", "\r\nright forever after; a failure mode named out loud; a forgery refused;\r\nand a trail that indicts itself.\r\n\r\n"]
